// Math Spec (Simplified)
// - Equation
//   - Addition "A + B"
//   - Subtraction "A - B"
//   - Multiplication "A * B"
//   - Division "A / B"
//   - Parentheses "(Equation)"
// ---------------------------------------------------------
@>P@.[*/+-]@.|$P"("$_")"
// ---------------------------------------------------------
// MicroPEG Breakdown
//
// Snails (Helper Utilities):
// @>       precedence parser for mathematical operations
// @.       number parser
//
// Symbols:
// @>P      precedence parser with label 'P'
// @.       snail helper (Left operand)
// [*/+-]   charset (matches any one of '*', '/', '+', '-')
// @.       snail helper (Right operand)
// |        or junction
// $P       reference to label 'P'
// "("      literal string
// $_       reference to root (Equation)
// ")"      literal string
